	'ch_p1' => 'Children experience allergic conditions differently from adults, requiring an environment where they feel relaxed and unhurried. Dr Tomasz Weber conducts our paediatric clinics every Wednesday between 13:00 and 17:00.',
	'ch_p2' => 'We examine common childhood presentations, including atopic eczema, suspected cow\'s milk protein allergy, egg allergy, peanut allergy, wheezing episodes, and seasonal hay fever. Skin-prick tests are adapted for children using gentle techniques that minimise discomfort, with results read while the child plays or reads with their parents.',
	'ch_p3' => 'Our aim is to demystify allergic symptoms for families, replacing anxiety with practical understanding and reassurance rooted in clear diagnostic evidence.',
