	'ct_i1' => 'We welcome enquiries for new consultations, diagnostic evaluations, and follow-up reviews at our Ghent clinic.',
	'ct_i2' => 'Patient coordinator Grace Mendes reviews all requests and replies within one working day.',
	'ct_p1' => 'Haru Allergy is located at Linden Quay 14, 9000 Ghent, Belgium. You can reach our reception team by telephone at +32 9 000 41 20 or by email at hello@haru-allergy.example. Our clinic is open Monday to Friday from 8:00 to 18:00, with a late clinic on Wednesday evenings until 19:30. On Saturdays, we are open from 9:00 to 12:30 for scheduled testing only; we are closed on Sundays. New-patient first consultations are held on Tuesday and Thursday mornings. The dedicated children\'s clinic operates on Wednesday afternoons from 13:00 to 17:00. Please contact us in advance to schedule your appointment, as we do not take walk-in consultations.',
	'ct_p2' => 'To help us direct your booking to the appropriate clinician and schedule sufficient time, please include a few specific details in your initial enquiry. Let us know whether the appointment is for an adult or a child, and state the primary reason for your visit, such as hay fever, asthma, eczema, food allergy, hives, or drug allergy. Describe your symptoms briefly and mention when they typically happen. Please list any medications currently being taken, especially antihistamines or inhalers, and state your preferred morning, choosing between Tuesday and Thursday. Grace Mendes reviews every enquiry carefully and replies within one working day to confirm your appointment date.',
