	'me_r1_p' => 'We begin with an unhurried sixty-minute conversation. We go through your timeline: when reactions start, which rooms and meals provoke them, how they behave across the year. Bring the medicines you take and photos of the rash, so we see the whole picture before any test is chosen.',
	'me_r1_t' => 'The history',
