	'me_r3_note' => 'One page,|for the fridge door.',
	'me_r3_p' => 'Before you leave, we turn the results into a written avoidance plan. One sheet of paper says what to keep away from and, just as important, what you can keep. It is made to live on the fridge door, a practical reference for you and everyone you live with.',
	'me_r3_t' => 'The plan',
