	'te_r1_p' => 'Our skin-prick test panel costs €90 and takes approximately forty minutes. Conducted by nurse lead Leah Fontaine, up to twenty allergen extracts are placed on your forearm with tiny, gentle pricks, and results are measured after fifteen to twenty minutes.',
