	'te_r2_p' => 'For delayed contact dermatitis, we offer a comprehensive patch test series priced at €210. This investigation requires three separate clinic visits within one week to apply patches, remove them, and read delayed skin reactions at seventy-two hours. Both tests provide immediate clarity regarding contact and airborne allergens.',
	'te_r2_t' => 'Patch test series',
